WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.286
ELEANOR BISHOP
So Kate is helping you

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:04.239
with an Avengers level threat?

00:00:04.289 --> 00:00:05.055
KATE BISHOP
He's my partner.

00:00:07.023 --> 00:00:07.945
CLINT BARTON
That's kind of a stretch.

00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:14.162
I've made a lot of powerful enemies.
I can't go home till I fix it.

00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:17.726
KATE BISHOP
We're in this together, right?

00:00:18.482 --> 00:00:20.103
CLINT BARTON
We need a ton of trick arrows.

00:00:23.217 --> 00:00:24.024
KATE BISHOP
Holy...

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:26.343
Gotta show me
how you make those.

